& [Fold1SubjectAndAuthority] probes supplied sequence commitment against physical inventory authority
  + [edge_probe] is deterministic digest success to strongest plausible provenance claim
  + [opposite_edge] is physical observation, enumeration completeness, temporal freshness, or receipt authority
  + [source_grounding] is SelectedPurpose, DigestSemantics, EvidenceGrades, EffectBoundary, and StopBoundary
  + [constraint_reapplication] is C03, C04, C05, C16, and C18 passed
  + [gain_delta] is the canonical public claim is fixed as supplied current-revalidated ordered-sequence commitment only
  + [pruned_material] is physical inventory digest, complete tree digest, receipt fragment, and witnessed commitment language
  + [remaining_frontier] is a separately governed physical producer and repeated-inventory comparison

& [Fold2ByteGrammarAndAmbiguity] probes every implicit representation choice
  + [edge_probe] is declared field value to architecture-independent unique hash bytes
  + [opposite_edge] is serializer order, native width, native endian, Unicode normalization, implicit option, implicit delimiter, or source discriminant
  + [source_grounding] is PrimitiveEncoding, ClosedTags, DigestSubject, and EvaluationOrder
  + [constraint_reapplication] is C06 through C11 and C19 passed
  + [gain_delta] is the versioned grammar is closed over domain, entry count, entry and field tags, fixed widths, explicit option presence, UTF-8 byte lengths, decoded fixed-width hex, and sequence counts
  + [pruned_material] is JSON, CBOR, serde-order, usize, Debug, textual numeric, normalization, and fallback tag encodings
  + [remaining_frontier] is no decoder or migration; any grammar change requires a new source and profile

& [Fold3CoverageAndOrder] probes omission, duplication, and permutation of observation meaning
  + [edge_probe] is one complete assembly member to every semantically committed observation and stream fact
  + [opposite_edge] is omitted optional presence, omitted empty sequence, duplicated field, reordered member, reordered stream, repaired ordinal, or inferred field
  + [source_grounding] is DigestSubject, ClosedTags, EvaluationOrder, Requirements, and Verification
  + [constraint_reapplication] is C05, C09, C10, and C11 passed
  + [gain_delta] is every TopologyEntryObservation and TopologyStreamFact field is committed exactly once in an exact order while the assembly's order remains untouched
  + [pruned_material] is sorting, ordinal repair, inferred defaults, omitted absent values, and unordered collection hashing
  + [remaining_frontier] is independent vectors and perturbation tests for every field class

& [Fold4RetentionAndHashSubject] probes the boundary between lineage retention and digest-subject exclusion
  + [edge_probe] is complete nonforgeable input lineage to the smallest receipt-compatible inventory-record subject
  + [opposite_edge] is bare digest output, lineage erasure, policy hashing, correlation hashing, or proof-process hashing
  + [source_grounding] is Input, DigestSubject, Output, and DigestSemantics
  + [constraint_reapplication] is C03, C12, and C14 passed
  + [gain_delta] is the output owns the complete assembly beside a digest that excludes plan, policy, correlation, carrier-profile, and proof-lineage syntax
  + [pruned_material] is raw observation input, bare digest return, generic From or Into, and lower proof-record inclusion
  + [remaining_frontier] is future receipt composition using distinct receipt fields under separate authority

& [Fold5ResourceFaultAndAtomicity] probes maximum failure pressure before and during streaming
  + [edge_probe] is malformed plan or contradictory assembly to bounded denial without partial success
  + [opposite_edge] is whole-inventory buffering, unchecked conversion, arithmetic wrap, leaked subject state, partial digest, or unbounded diagnostics
  + [source_grounding] is Plan, StreamingBound, Faults, EvaluationOrder, and StopBoundary
  + [constraint_reapplication] is C01, C02, C05, C13, C15, and C20 passed
  + [gain_delta] is predecode cap, representable counts, checked accounting, stack-bounded fixed-width decoding, incremental hashing, bounded faults, and result atomicity are jointly required
  + [pruned_material] is public byte accumulation, duplicate observation collection, partial hash exposure, and full-record fault payload
  + [remaining_frontier] is focused overflow, malformed-hex, count, accounting, and bounded-diagnostic tests

& [Fold6ImplementationSeamAndVerification] probes the smallest code shape that remains independently auditable
  + [edge_probe] is one closed grammar to production and independent proof responsibilities
  + [opposite_edge] is generic encoder framework, reused production logic as its own oracle, alternate dependency, hidden effect, or unverifiable tag coverage
  + [source_grounding] is StreamingBound, Verification, Rollback, and accepted GrowthG01 through GrowthG03
  + [constraint_reapplication] is C11, C13, C17, C18, and C20 passed
  + [gain_delta] is one subject-local module may contain private named tags, private hash-sink helpers, one public transform, and tests with at least one separately assembled reference byte vector
  + [pruned_material] is public encoder API, accumulator extraction, new crate, filesystem fixture, platform probe, and production-helper-only expected values
  + [remaining_frontier] is static API and effect scanning plus global debug, release, quality, audit, and recursive evidence

& [Fold7LifecycleCompatibilityAndReroute] probes change, rollback, and downstream composition
  + [edge_probe] is version 0.1 implementation readiness to future grammar, comparison, and receipt pressure
  + [opposite_edge] is silent migration, digest reinterpretation, profile negotiation, rollback erasure, or unauthorized next-stage composition
  + [source_grounding] is Compatibility, DigestSemantics, Rollback, StopBoundary, and deferred GrowthG04 and GrowthG05
  + [constraint_reapplication] is C01, C02, C12, C16, C17, C18, C19, and C20 passed
  + [gain_delta] is exact profile identity, source-preserving rollback, and new-authority reroute conditions remain explicit
  + [pruned_material] is backward-compatible guessing, implicit default profile, mutable meaning for existing digests, and automatic receipt construction
  + [remaining_frontier] is separately source-preserved comparison or new-profile work only after a concrete consumer exists

& [CrossFoldReview] finds stable convergence
  + [stable_structure] is strict plan plus complete assembly, current pure validation, exact correlation checks, closed canonical update stream, private SHA-256 sink, lineage-retaining output, bounded atomic faults, and zero effects
  + [stable_nonclaim] is no physical origin, enumeration, completeness, temporal equality, receipt, admission, mutation, or promotion authority
  + [stable_proof_shape] is independent known vectors, sensitivity and intentional-exclusion tests, static API and effect checks, two build profiles, global quality, audit, provenance, rollback, and recursive evidence
  + [constraint_result] is C01 through C20 survive every fold
  + [conflict_result] is none
  + [source_revision_required] is false

